resources: give the expert cache enough room to hold every expert when the host can -- the 0.8 factor was tuned on a 47GB box and on the 371GB L20 it left the pool at 231.4GB (13214 entries) against the 268.9GB the model actually needs, so warm-up could never complete and decode read 13-25 experts from disk every step with a full _miss_scan sync per layer